# This drive holds many unrelated old experiment/scratch folders alongside the
# two GLSense codebases. Only track FinalWorkingCode/ and AIPowered/ - everything
# else at the root is ignored.
/*
!/FinalWorkingCode/
!/AIPowered/
!/.gitignore
!/README.md

# --- Build/IDE artifacts (either codebase, any depth) ---
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/packages/
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/*.pdb
**/GLSense.Addin.Core/SetupFiles/

# --- Logs (both codebases write runtime logs under a Logs/ folder) ---
**/Logs/
**/*.log

# --- Claude Code session artifacts (local settings, brainstorming-companion
# mockup/state files) - personal/session-scoped, never meant to be shared ---
**/.claude/settings.local.json
**/.superpowers/
**/.github/

# --- FinalWorkingCode-specific excludes ---
/FinalWorkingCode/MigrationBackup/

# --- AIPowered-specific excludes: bkpup1/bkpup2 are the user's own manual
# whole-solution backups taken before/during the multi-project rewrite. Now that
# this is under version control, git history replaces the need for them, so
# they're left on disk but not tracked. Revisit if you want them tracked instead. ---
/AIPowered/bkpup1/
/AIPowered/bkpup2/

# Built installer output is a build artifact, not source - the .vdproj it's built
# from stays tracked. VS Setup (.vdproj) projects build into Debug/Release folders
# directly under the project folder (not bin/obj), and this repo has had more than
# one such project (GLSenseSetup, OrbitGLSenseSetups) - match any "*Setup*"-named
# folder so a future rename/recreation doesn't need this list updated again.
**/*Setup*/Debug/
**/*Setup*/Release/
